    "meaning": "not",
    "shortDefinition": "Negates verbs, adjectives and nouns with der/die/das."
  },
  "intro": {
    "title": "Nicht or kein?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Nicht is 'not'. It negates verbs (ich komme nicht), adjectives (nicht teuer) and nouns that have der, die, das or a possessive. For nouns with ein or no article, use kein."
    ]
  },
  "wordFamily": [
